# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated pipeline artefacts.
# Every one of these folders is recreated by the code that writes it
# (config.py mkdirs data/ and kg/, 05b mkdirs models/, research_multihorizon
# mkdirs forecast_outputs/), so a fresh clone runs without them.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
data/
kg/
models/
forecast_outputs/

# Results you DO want versioned go in here instead — see the note below.
!results_archive/

# ── Scraper caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# bpdb_page3_pdfs/ holds one PDF per day since 2019. Thousands of files,
# hundreds of MB. Never commit it; dataset_from_website.py rebuilds it.
bpdb_page3_pdfs/
bpdb_page3_url_cache.json
bpdb_page3_parse_cache.json
bpdb_page3_weather_cache.json
bpdb_page3_failed_downloads.txt
bpdb_page3_failed_parses.txt
*.log

# Secondary scraper output; the CSV is the source of truth and IS tracked.
BPDB_Dhaka_City_Substations_Page3.xlsx

# ── Model / binary artefacts (safety net, in case one escapes a folder) ──
*.keras
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.npz
*.parquet

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT ignored, and must stay tracked:
#   BPDB_Dhaka_City_Substations_Page3.csv   the raw record (~950 KB) — the
#                                           remote box needs this to train
#   *.py                                    all pipeline code
#   *.pdf                                   proposal / mathematical model
#   results_archive/                        selection CSVs you cite
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
